            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "fivecoat15"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and tasty! Clean up was super easy too! Healthy attempt, so I used whole wheat pasta and no salt in the water. Lots of flavors from the shrimp, capers, artichoke and lemon. I substituted 1/4 cup clam juice and a hefty sprinkle of Parmesan cheese for the butter and wine adding 1/2 a lemon squeezed on the plate. The Parmesan helped thicken up the juice/sauce a bit. This is a new staple in my home!",
            "datePublished": "2019-06-21T02:20:37.327Z"
          },
          {
