              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Erica McLean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this dish! So simple and quick to make. I added a few onions and garlic and left out the artichokes because I didn't have any. I thickened the juice with a little corn starch to make it a sauce and it tuned out great. Thank you",
